  "description": "GUHRUY crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H161 Cr4 La4 N9 O37,2(C1 H2 Cl2). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 10 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 8 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 8 O neighbors; Cr1 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr2 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; La2B (La) has 8 O neighbors; Cr1B (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr2B (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr3? (Cr) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.486-4.481 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.81-118.72°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C82H161Cr4La4N9O37·2CH2Cl2. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
